[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3084\u3042\u3001\u6B21\u306F\u3069\u3093\u306A\u8A71\u304C\u51FA\u3066\u304F\u308B\u306E\u304B\n\u697D\u3057\u307F\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u304D\u305F\u306A\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ha! I can\u0027t wait to hear what story comes next!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30AF\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304F\u3063\u2026\u2026\u3082\u3046\u6BBA\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... Just kill me now..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6B21\u306B\u8A9E\u308B\u306F\u3001\u82F1\u96C4\u306E\u59CB\u307E\u308A\u306E\u7269\u8A9E\u3002\n\u5E7C\u304D\u9803\u306E\u8A18\u61B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Next, I shall tell the tale of a hero\u0027s beginning.\nA memory from childhood."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5C06\u6765\u306E\u5922\u306F\u304A\u83D3\u5B50\u5C4B\u3068\u53E3\u305A\u3055\u3080\u3001\n\u8FB2\u5BB6\u306B\u751F\u307E\u308C\u3057\u4E09\u5144\u5F1F\u306E\u5FC3\u512A\u3057\u304D\u672B\u5A18",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The kind-hearted youngest of three siblings, born to farmers,\nwho dreamed of opening a candy shop."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3078\u3048\u3001\u5C0F\u3055\u3044\u9803\u306F\u304A\u83D3\u5B50\u5C4B\u306B\u306A\u308A\u305F\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh? So you wanted to be a candy maker when you were little?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6BCD\u4E0A\u2026\u2026\u3057\u3083\u3079\u3063\u305F\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mother... you told them that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3042\u308B\u3058\u3083\u3093\u304B\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, that\u0027s actually pretty cute!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30AF\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3057\u304B\u3057\u305D\u3053\u306B\u73FE\u308B\u7ADC\u306E\u5F71\u3002\n\u713C\u304D\u5C3D\u304F\u3055\u308C\u3057\u6545\u90F7\u306E\u5730",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But then appeared the dragon\u0027s shadow.\nTheir homeland, reduced to ashes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u305D\u3063\u304B\u3002\u6545\u90F7\u304C\u7ADC\u306B\u8972\u308F\u308C\u305F\u3093\u3060\u3063\u3051",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Right. Your hometown was attacked by a dragon..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3042\u3002\u7551\u3082\u5BB6\u755C\u3082\u5BB6\u3082\u3001\u3059\u3079\u3066\u3092\u5931\u3063\u305F\u3002\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u5BB6\u65CF\u306F\n\u305D\u308C\u305E\u308C\u9060\u65B9\u306E\u89AA\u621A\u306B\u5F15\u304D\u53D6\u3089\u308C\u6563\u308A\u6563\u308A\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. We lost everything\u2014our fields, our livestock, our home. Our family was separated,\neach of us taken in by distant relatives."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u767D\u591C\u306E\u9A0E\u58EB\u3068\u3057\u3066\u306E\u79C1\u306F\u3001\u305D\u3053\u304B\u3089\u59CB\u307E\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\u3002\n\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306F\u7ADC\u3078\u306E\u5FA9\u8B90\u5FC3\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s where my journey as a Knight of the Midnight Sun began.\nIt all started with a desire for revenge against dragons."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3057\u304B\u3057\u4E09\u3064\u5B50\u306E\u9B42\u767E\u307E\u3067\u3002\u512A\u3057\u304D\u5FC3\u306F\u4ECA\u3082\u5909\u308F\u3089\u305A\u3002\n\u96E2\u308C\u305F\u5BB6\u65CF\u3092\u518D\u3073\u96C6\u3081\u3001\u738B\u306E\u90FD\u3067\u5BB6\u65CF\u306F\u5E78\u305B\u306B\u66AE\u3089\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yet her gentle soul remained unchanged. The family reunited,\nnow living happily in the royal capital."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u82F1\u96C4\u306E\u5FC3\u306E\u706F\u306F\u3001\u5FA9\u8B90\u306B\u975E\u305A\u3002\u7FA9\u52D9\u611F\u306B\u975E\u305A\u3002\n\u305F\u3060\u305F\u3060\u5BB6\u65CF\u3092\u5B88\u308B\u3068\u3044\u3046\u5207\u306A\u308B\u9858\u3044\u306B\u3042\u308A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The hero\u0027s flame burns not for vengeance, nor duty,\nbut for the pure wish to protect her family."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u305D\u3046\u3060\u306D\u3002\u541B\u306F\u305A\u3063\u3068\u3001\u5BB6\u65CF\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3060\u3051\u3092\n\u8003\u3048\u3066\u3044\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...That\u0027s right. You\u0027ve always thought only of\nyour family."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3092\u767D\u591C\u306E\u9A0E\u58EB\u306B\u52E7\u8A98\u3057\u305F\u6642\u3060\u3063\u3066\u305D\u3046\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It was the same when we recruited you to the Knights of the Midnight Sun."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u541B\u306F\u6761\u4EF6\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3001\u5BB6\u65CF\u307F\u3093\u306A\u3092\u738B\u90FD\u306B\u4F4F\u307E\u308F\u305B\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3092\n\u63D0\u793A\u3057\u3066\u304D\u305F\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You made it a condition that your entire family\nwould be allowed to live in the capital."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u5229\u79C1\u6B32\u306B\u8D70\u308B\u8005\u3082\u591A\u3044\u3060\u308D\u3046\u306B\u3001\n\u541B\u306F\u81EA\u5206\u3088\u308A\u3082\u5BB6\u65CF\u306E\u5E78\u305B\u3092\u53D6\u3063\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "While many seek personal gain,\nyou chose your family\u0027s happiness over your own."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u738B\u5BAE\u306F\u541B\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\u4FE1\u983C\u3057\u3066\u3001\u30EA\u30D2\u30E3\u30EB\u30C8\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\n\u4EFB\u305B\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s why the royal court trusts you with\nRichard\u0027s care."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u305D\u3046\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3060\u3051\u308B\u306E\u306F\u5B09\u3057\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u3067\u3082\u3001\u79C1\u306E\u59CB\u307E\u308A\u306F\u78BA\u304B\u306B\u5FA9\u8B90\u5FC3\u3067\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I\u0027m honored you would say that.\nBut my beginning truly was rooted in revenge."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5E2B\u5320\u304C\u3044\u306A\u3051\u308C\u3070\u3001\u79C1\u306F\u304D\u3063\u3068\u305D\u306E\u307E\u307E\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If not for Master, I surely would have remained that way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5192\u967A\u8005\u30E4\u30B9\u30DF\u30FC\u30F3\u304B\u3002\u5049\u5927\u306A\u5192\u967A\u8005\u3068\u3057\u3066\u8A18\u9332\u306B\n\u6B8B\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u304C\u3001\u79C1\u306F\u5F7C\u5973\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\u3042\u307E\u308A\u77E5\u3089\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Adventurer Yasmine... The records speak of her as a great adventurer,\nbut I know little about her personally."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6559\u3048\u3066\u304F\u308C\u306A\u3044\u304B\uFF1F\u3000\u5F7C\u5973\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Would you tell me about her?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304D\u3063\u3068\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA\u304C\u6B4C\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002\n\u5E2B\u5320\u3068\u306E\u65E5\u3005\u306B\u3064\u3044\u3066\u306F\u3001\u8272\u3005\u8A71\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m sure Diona will sing of that.\nI\u0027ve told her many stories about my days with Master."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]